<P class="tit">2025年国际创新实践周——企业/创新课堂课程介绍</P>
<P class="zd"><SPAN>2025-05-28</SPAN><SPAN>审核人：<!--</SPAN><span style="color:red;">审核人参数配置未打开</span><SPAN>-->(已浏览<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1070628979, 19123)</script>)</SPAN></P>
    <div id="vsb_content_2" class="ny"><div class="v_news_content">
<table align="center" style="width: 757px; table-layout: fixed;"><colgroup><col data-offset-left="220.3551025390625" data-offset-right="259.5028266906738" data-resize-pixel="39.14772415161133" data-resize-percent="5.1714298747174805" style="width: 5.1714%;"><col data-offset-left="259.5028381347656" data-offset-right="324.1193161010742" data-resize-pixel="64.6164779663086" data-resize-percent="8.535862346936405" style="width: 8.5359%;"><col data-offset-left="324.1192932128906" data-offset-right="418.3692932128906" data-resize-pixel="94.25" data-resize-percent="12.450462351387054" style="width: 12.4505%;"><col data-offset-left="395.3692932128906" data-offset-right="505.9232635498047" data-resize-pixel="110.55397033691406" data-resize-percent="14.60422329417623" style="width: 14.6042%;"><col data-offset-left="505.92327880859375" data-offset-right="631.7187271118164" data-resize-pixel="125.79544830322266" data-resize-percent="16.617628573741435" style="width: 16.6176%;"><col data-offset-left="631.71875" data-offset-right="687.7698860168457" data-resize-pixel="56.0511360168457" data-resize-percent="7.40437728095716" style="width: 7.4044%;"><col data-offset-left="687.7698364257812" data-offset-right="774.8294906616211" data-resize-pixel="87.05965423583984" data-resize-percent="11.500614826398921" style="width: 11.5006%;"><col data-offset-left="774.8295288085938" data-offset-right="858.5085067749023" data-resize-pixel="83.6789779663086" data-resize-percent="11.054026151427818" style="width: 11.054%;"><col data-offset-left="858.5084838867188" data-offset-right="952.35791015625" data-resize-pixel="93.84942626953125" data-resize-percent="12.397546402844286" style="width: 12.3975%;"></colgroup><tbody><tr class="firstRow"><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="vsbcontent_start"><strong>序号</strong></p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p><strong>开课学院</strong></p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p><strong>课程编号</strong></p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p><strong>课程类别（企业课堂/创新课堂）</strong></p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p><strong>课程名</strong></p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p><strong>学分/学时</strong></p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p><strong>可选课年级（大一至大三学生可选）</strong></p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p><strong>可选课专业（也可以是某类专业、工科、理科等）</strong></p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p><strong>先修课程（如没有填“无”）</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>1</p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>通信工程学院</p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>24IC7001</p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>企业课堂</p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>《职业生涯管理：如何把工作折腾成你想要的样子》</p><p><a href="https://ie.xidian.edu.cn/info/1062/4234.htm" target="_self" textvalue="（点击查看）">（点击查看）</a></p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>1学分/16学时</p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>大一至大三</p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>不限专业</p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>无</p></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>2</p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>通信工程学院</p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>24IC7002</p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>企业课堂</p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>硬实时+Linux双系统实验</p><p><a href="https://ie.xidian.edu.cn/info/1062/4224.htm" target="_self">（点击查看）</a></p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><p>1学分/16学时</p></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;">